message:
import yml or yaml (#6990)

* import yml or yaml

* improve error handling

fix(backend): do not cache graphql queries using expand

@expand mutates the Document object so we cannot cache it.

Signed-off-by: ub6b8c92a6359829a <ub6b8c92a6359829a@users.invalid>

chore(workflows): disable report-failure-as-issue for bug-agent workflows (#9336)

Avoids auto-filing GitHub issues when a bug-agent workflow run fails;
failures should surface via the existing PR/issue comment outputs only.
